WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.371 --> 00:00:01.556
(lighthearted instrumental music)

00:00:01.556 --> 00:00:04.639
- Good day! (laughs)

00:00:05.626 --> 00:00:09.293
We grow giant marrows,
four foot in a month.

00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:12.105
45 inches.

00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:16.704
These marrows would taste exactly the same

00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:18.715
as a normal marrow.

00:00:18.715 --> 00:00:20.107
Nice and tender and lush.

00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:21.543
Some of them look a bit tough,

00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:25.611
but once you cut into
them, they cut like butter.

00:00:25.611 --> 00:00:26.780
My name is  Phillip Vowles.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:30.746
I live in Llanharry, Wales
and I grow giant vegetables.

00:00:30.746 --> 00:00:33.721
(lively instrumental music)

00:00:33.721 --> 00:00:35.414
I've been growing giant vegetables now

00:00:35.414 --> 00:00:37.730
for the last 30 years.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.843
I come from a very large family.

00:00:39.843 --> 00:00:42.058
My mother had 17 children.

00:00:42.058 --> 00:00:46.380
13 of us survived, and I think, 
you know, that was something, you know,

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.675
big vegetables feed big families.

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:51.944
You know, I’m up here every morning, every night,

00:00:51.944 --> 00:00:54.053
every single day of the week.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:57.393
There's a lot of love
and care goes into it.

00:00:57.393 --> 00:01:00.676
Sometimes I do a bit of
talking to them as well

00:01:00.676 --> 00:01:02.323
to encourage them to grow

00:01:02.323 --> 00:01:04.795
which is a bit of, you know, a bit of fun.

00:01:04.795 --> 00:01:07.419
I think he's just about
finished growing there now.

00:01:07.419 --> 00:01:09.380
I got to be very careful
the wife is not about

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.385
when I start talking to my vegetables,

00:01:11.385 --> 00:01:13.958
but it's all good fun.

00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:16.942
I broke the world record
for the heaviest cucumber

00:01:16.942 --> 00:01:19.053
what, 25 years ago.

00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:22.549
It weighed 18 1/2 pound
and it was just incredible

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.353
the way it grew.

00:01:24.353 --> 00:01:28.624
When I started, if we had a
marrow 20, 30 pound in weight,

00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:30.013
you had a big marrow.

00:01:30.013 --> 00:01:32.898
Now, we're up over a 100 pound in weight.

00:01:32.898 --> 00:01:36.859
A normal cabbage would
be two pound in weight,

00:01:36.859 --> 00:01:39.526
but we're growing 'em 120 pound.

00:01:41.109 --> 00:01:45.276
You know, you can feed 120, 130, 140
people off one cabbage.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:49.400
This is why I supply the local pub,

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.438
and they use 'em up for Sunday lunch.

00:01:52.438 --> 00:01:55.671
I've developed my own
strain, more or less, now.

00:01:55.671 --> 00:01:58.968
I select my own seed every year,

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.818
the biggest and the best seed,

00:02:00.818 --> 00:02:05.092
and it just seems to be
improving which is incredible.

00:02:05.092 --> 00:02:06.788
I grow organically.

00:02:06.788 --> 00:02:09.829
I had to think, if I can
do it, anybody can do it,

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:12.038
and it's a big thrill every day.

00:02:12.038 --> 00:02:15.523
The wife say, "What am I
doing up the lot every day?"

00:02:15.523 --> 00:02:18.356
And when she comes up she realize.

